          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "bash",
          "lines": [
            "docker run -d -p 5000:5000 \\",
            "  --name reg registry:2",
            "docker tag app localhost:5000/app",
            "docker push localhost:5000/app"
          ],
          "note": "registry:2 has no auth or TLS"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Anonymous Hub pulls are ==rate limited== per IP; log in to raise it",
            "CI runners share one IP: use a token or a ==pull-through cache==",
            "Self-host `registry:2` behind TLS and auth, or run Harbor",
            "Scan before push (`docker scout cves`, `trivy`); **sign** with cosign"
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        }
      ],
