      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. Definition: least privilege",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "==Least privilege==: non-root `USER`, `--cap-drop=ALL`, never `--privileged`",
            "`--read-only` root fs + `--tmpfs` for writable dirs: attacker cannot ==persist== changes",
            "Mounting `/var/run/docker.sock` = full control of host Docker; treat as **root**"
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "sticky",
          "title": "Deny by default",
          "text": "Start from `--cap-drop=ALL --read-only --user app`, then add back only what breaks. The cgroup knobs here are the same ones page 3 explained."
        },
