          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Secrets never via `ENV` or `ARG`: they stay visible in `docker history`",
            "==Runtime==: secret-store env vars, Docker/Compose secrets mounted as files",
            "==Build-time==: BuildKit `RUN --mount=type=secret`, **never** baked into layers"
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "3. Images: Pin, Scan, Shrink",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Pin base to version or ==digest==: `node:22-slim@sha256:...`; rebuild regularly for patches",
            "Scan in CI: `docker scout cves`, `trivy image`; **fail** on critical CVEs",
            "Minimal bases (slim, alpine, distroless) cut attack surface and CVE count",
            "Distroless has no shell: no easy `docker exec` foothold for attackers"
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
