          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. Definition: the container contract",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "==One process per container==: web, worker, db separate; compose or orchestrator wires them",
            "==Immutable images==: settings through `-e` env vars and mounted config files",
            "`docker exec` edits **vanish** on restart; rebuild the image instead",
            "==Twelve-factor logging==: write to stdout/stderr, read with `docker logs`",
            "State only in ==named volumes== or external services; container safe to delete any time"
          ],
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
