          "type": "heading",
          "text": "3. Example: a lean, cache-friendly build",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "dockerfile",
          "lines": [
            "FROM node:22-slim AS build",
            "WORKDIR /app",
            "COPY package*.json ./",
            "RUN npm ci && npm cache clean -f",
            "COPY . .",
            "FROM node:22-slim",
            "WORKDIR /app",
            "COPY --from=build /app /app"
          ],
          "note": "deps before source; slim final stage"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "==Multi-stage== + slim base + `.dockerignore` keep the image small",
            "Clean package caches in the **same** RUN layer, or the junk stays",
            "Dependencies before source: a code edit never reinstalls packages",
            "Pin versions in `package.json` / lockfile for reproducible builds",
            "Tag `app:1.4-ab12cd` (version + git SHA); ==deploy by digest==, never `latest`",
            "User-defined network + service names, not hard-coded IPs or **--link** (deprecated)"
          ],
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
