        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "4. Common Mistakes",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "==latest drift==: base image changes months later, build breaks silently",
            "arm64 Mac → amd64 server without `--platform`: **exec format error**",
            "`.git` or `node_modules` missing from `.dockerignore`: huge context, slow builds",
            "Daemon on TCP ==2375 without TLS==: unauthenticated **root** on the host",
            "Patching a running container with `docker exec`: lost on next restart"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "bash",
          "lines": [
            "docker system df",
            "docker system prune -a --volumes",
            "docker build --platform \\",
            "  linux/amd64 -t app:1.4-ab12cd .",
            "docker pull app@sha256:9f3c..."
          ],
          "note": "prune destroys unused data; run df first"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. Images & Containers",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "bash",
          "lines": [
            "docker build -t name:tag .",
            "docker images           # list",
            "docker pull img | push img",
            "docker rmi img          # delete",
            "docker history img      # layers",
            "docker image prune      # dangling"
          ],
          "note": "tag defaults to latest"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Copy ==dependency manifests== and install **before** `COPY . .`",
            "One `RUN` per logical step; cleanup in the ==same layer==",
            "Cache misses top-down: a source edit must not reinstall deps"
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "Networks",
          "items": [
            "`docker network create net` | `ls` | `inspect` | `connect net c`",
            "Drivers: ==bridge==, host, none, overlay, macvlan",
            "User-defined nets resolve containers **by name**",
            "Default bridge resolves by IP only"
          ],
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "dockerfile",
          "lines": [
            "FROM node:20 AS builder",
            "RUN npm ci && npm run build",
            "FROM node:20-slim",
            "COPY --from=builder /out /app"
          ],
          "note": "docker build --target builder runs tests"
